  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BIMP ROK Cooperation Fund (BKCF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fund size: USD 1 million for 2021 and USD 3 million for 2022MOFA and GGGI agreed that GGGI will act in two functions/roles:1) The GGGI will function as a depository to manage submitted proposals from BIMP countries (Brunei, Indonesia, Malaysia, and the Philippines);2) The GGGI will propose possible sectors/themes, where GGGI will invite interested BIMP countries to participate in submitting proposals.</narrative>
  </description>
